Language English

Book Foyer Ordered No Keep Looped
	Page ExploreFoyerViaGallery
		Not Visible
		Triggered BY @ExploreFoyerViaGallery
		
		Prolog """
			Up close, you can see how beautiful the door is:  ornate carvings
			and beautiful hardware. This door has a small plaque that reads
			<<Foyer.>>
		"""
		Button "Explore"
		
		No Text
		
		exploredFoyerViaGallery = true
		Goto PlaceFoyer
	End Page ExploreFoyerViaGallery
	
	Page ExploreFoyerViaHall2
		Not Visible
		Triggered BY @ExploreFoyerViaHall2 When foundSarah
		
		Prolog "This door has a small brass plaque that reads <<Foyer.>>"
		Button "Explore"
		
		No Text

		exploredFoyerViaHall2 = true
		Goto PlaceFoyer
	End Page ExploreFoyerViaHall2
	
	Page ExploreVoyerViaHall2NoSarah
		Not Visible
		Triggered BY @ExploreFoyerViaHall2 When Not foundSarah
		
		Text """
			As you reach for the door, your eye is drawn back to the
			painting behind you. You cannot help but look at it.
		"""

		Exit
	End Page ExploreVoyerViaHall2NoSarah
	
	Page ExploreFoyerViaStudy
		Not Visible
		Triggered By @ExploreFoyerViaStudy
		
		Prolog "This door leads farther into the house."
		Button "Explore"
		
		No Text

		exploredFoyerViaStudy = true
		Goto PlaceFoyer
	End Page ExploreFoyerViaStudy
	
	Page ExploreGalleryViaFoyer
		Not Visible
		Triggered By @ExploreGalleryViaFoyer
		
		Text """
			The door is beautiful:  beautifully carved and finished. You try
			the handle, but it is locked.
		"""
		Exit
	End Page ExploreGalleryViaFoyer
	
	Page PlaceFoyer
		Remove TokenExploreFoyerViaGallery, TokenExploreFoyerViaHall2, TokenExploreFoyerViaStudy
		Add TileFoyer
		
		Text """
			The foyer is a large, nearly-empty space with a front door, stairs,
			and other doors leading to various parts of the house. Place the
			{c:TileFoyer} tile then discard all Explore tokens leading to this
			room.
		"""
		
		exploredFoyer = true
	End Page PlaceFoyer

	Page PlaceExploreStudy
		Not Visible When exploredStudy
		
		Add TokenExploreStudyViaFoyer!
		
		// Assume ViaHall2
		Text """
			Across the stairs is another door leading farther into the
			house. Place an Explore token as indicated.
		"""
		
		If exploredFoyerViaGallery Then Text """
			Across the room and up some stairs, a door leads farther into the
			house. Place an Explore token as indicated.
		"""
	End Page PlaceExploreStudy
	
	Page PlaceExploreGallery
		Not Visible When exploredGallery
		
		Add TokenExploreGalleryViaFoyer
		Text """
			An ornate door leads further into the house. Place an Explore
			token as indicated.
		"""
	End Page PlaceExploreGallery
	
	Page PlaceCandles
		Add TokenSearchFoyerCandles!

		// assume via Hall2
		Text """
			Next to you is a painting that piques your interest. Place a Search
			token as indicated.
		"""
		
		If exploredFoyerViaGallery Then Text """
			Up the stairs to your left, a painting piques your interest. Place
			a Search token as indicated.
		"""
		
		If exploredFoyerViaStudy Then Text """
			Next to a door across the stairs, a painting piques your interest.
			Place a Search token as indicated.
		"""
	End Page PlaceCandles
	
	Page PlaceSearchRandom
		Add TokenSearchFoyerRandom!

		Text """
			A small secretary sits next to the entry. It has many compartments
			and drawers, some hanging open. Place a Search token as indicated.
		"""
	End Page PlaceSearchRandom
	
	Page PlaceExploreFrontDoor
		Add TokenExploreFoyerFrontDoor!

		Text """
			The front door seems to be in good repair, but the glass set into
			it is as filthy as that door off the driveway. Place an Explore
			token as indicated.
		"""
	End Page PlaceExploreFrontDoor
	
	Page PlaceSearchSpell
		If exploredFoyerViaStudy Then Add TokenSearchFoyerSpellRight!
		If Not exploredFoyerViaStudy Then Add TokenSearchFoyerSpellLeft!
		
		TEXT """
			A mirror across the room looks interesting. Place a Search token
			as indicated.
		"""
		
		Trigger @MoveAfterExplore
		Exit
	End Page PlaceSearchSpell
	
	Page SearchRandom
		Not Visible
		Triggered BY @SearchFoyerRandom
		
		Prolog """
			An old cabinet with a set of compartments and drawers sits next to
			the door. Several drawers are half open, like whoever last looked
			through them was in a hurry.
		"""
		Button "Search"
		
		Text QItemFoyerRandom """
			You dig through the various drawers and compartments and eventually
			find something useful. Gain the {c:QItemFoyerRandom} Common Item,
			then discard this Search token.
		"""
		
		Remove TokenSearchFoyerRandom
		Exit
	End Page SearchRandom
	
	Page SearchSpell
		Not Visible
		Triggered By @SearchFoyerSpell
		
		Prolog """
			This table sits under a fancy mirror. There is nothing on the table
			but dust. It does have several drawers.
		"""
		Button "Search"
		
		Text QItemFoyerSpell """
			You go through the drawers one-by-one, finding little of interest.
			Finally, in the last drawer, you find a small pamphlet with arcane 
			symbols and odd poetry. Gain the {c:QItemFoyerSpell} spell, then
			discard this Search token.
		"""
		
		Remove TokenSearchFoyerSpellLeft, TokenSearchFoyerSpellRight
		Exit
	End Page SearchSpell
	
	Page SearchCandles
		Not Visible
		Triggered By @SearchFoyerCandles
		
		Prolog """
			This painting is compelling. Something about it makes you want to
			have a closer look.
		"""
		Button "Search"
		
		Text QItemCandles """
			You quickly realize what drew you to the painting:  the man’s eyes
			glisten and meet yours as if he were alive. He sits in a chair in
			front of his wife and two children, all standing. You recognize one
			of the children as Sarah and the other child looks like you. The
			man must be your father, Elias Smythe. Still,
			you don’t see anything that will help you with the house. As you
			turn away, you notice the sconces on either side of the painting.
			Some of the darker areas of the house could use a little light. You
			reach out and take a candle.

			Gain the {c:QItemCandles} Common Item, then discard this Search
			token.
		"""
		
		Remove TokenSearchFoyerCandles
		
		foundCandles = true
		Exit
	End Page SearchCandles
	
	Page ExploreFrontDoor
		Not Visible
		Triggered By @ExploreFoyerFrontDoor
		
		Prolog """
			The door seems unfazed by age. A small window purports to look out
			on the grounds. Maybe you can get out of this madhouse.
		"""
		Button "Explore"
		
		Text """
			You grab and twist the knob but your hand just slides over it. No
			matter how you try, you cannot turn the knob. The window is so
			filthy that you cannot see through it.

			If you were still worried about cleaning, this would be a lot of
			work.

			Discard this explore token.
		"""
		
		Remove TokenExploreFoyerFrontDoor
		Exit
	End Page ExploreFrontDoor
End Book Foyer